<title>INDIA: IFCI sees higher disbursements in 97/98.</title>
<headline>IFCI sees higher disbursements in 97/98.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Finance Corp of India Ltd (IFCI) has set a disbursement goal of 70 billion rupees for 1997/98 (April-March) against actual disbursements of 51.6 billion in the previous year, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
</text>
